iProteinStudio licensing status
================================

No licence is currently granted for the original iProteinStudio source code.
Copyright ownership and an appropriate release licence are under institutional
review. Making this repository readable on GitHub does not place that code in
the public domain and does not grant permission to redistribute it.

This statement does not change the licences of third-party components. Those
components remain available under their respective terms; see LICENSING.md and
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Do not replace this file with an open-source licence until authorship,
sponsorship, third-party materials and the MIT Technology Licensing Office
release process have been resolved in writing.
